## 2026-09-10T10:35+02:00 — R2 dispositioned (7 findings, 7 ACCEPT, 0 REJECT), returned to Step 2 to probe, plan_v3 written
Two consecutive all-accept rounds triggered the PLAN.md rule that review is doing design work, so before writing v3 I probed the claims v3 rests on instead of reasoning about them. Probe transcript:
